<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Anomalocaris canadensis Turing wavenumber k_c at 24 µm (508 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each scored closure is a named function with a docstring that points at the law. The Lean file proves the integer forms of the trace sign, the diffusion-ratio gate, the sub-facet inequality, and the age order. There is no line-by-line map onto Turing's 1952 section numbers." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Anomalocaris canadensis Turing wavenumber k_c at 24 µm (508 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The code integrates the Schnakenberg PDE, evaluates the Turing discriminant, and checks the discrete growth rate against the stencil symbol at 14 wavenumbers (r = 0.999989). The kinetics are the standard spot system, not a rate law measured on this fossil." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Anomalocaris canadensis Turing wavenumber k_c at 24 µm (508 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
